{"applicability_conditions":"适用于 Fe-Mn-Al-C（Fe-Mn-Al-C）钢；其奥氏体中 C 固溶量一般低于 1.2 wt%，以抑制塑性加工中的碳化物析出和裂纹产生，因此密度主要与 Al 和 Mn 含量相关。","identity":{"block_id":"b0023","equation_id":"equation_001","equation_number":"1","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\rho = 8. 1 5 - 0. 1 0 1 \\omega (\\mathrm{Al}) - 0. 4 1 \\omega (\\mathrm{C}) - 0. 0 0 8 5 \\omega (\\mathrm{Mn})\\tag{1}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2023.06.037"},"latex":"\\rho = 8.15 - 0.101 \\omega(\\mathrm{Al}) - 0.41 \\omega(\\mathrm{C}) - 0.0085 \\omega(\\mathrm{Mn})","purpose":"计算 Fe-Mn-Al-C 钢的密度，说明其密度由合金成分决定。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Fe-Mn-Al-C 钢的密度","symbol":"\\rho","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Al 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{Al})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"C 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{C})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Mn 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{Mn})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"8.15","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"0.101","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"0.41","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"0.0085","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["公式引用文献 [19]。","文中指出 C 含量对降低密度作用最显著，但 Fe-Mn-Al-C 钢奥氏体中 C 固溶量一般低于 1.2 wt%（文献 [20-22]），故密度主要与 Al、Mn 含量相关。","文中比较：Mn 密度为 7.2 g/cm³，Al 密度为 2.7 g/cm³，Al 在降低密度方面优势明显，低密度主要由 Al 含量控制。"]}